⍝ Run all tests — pre-existing and merge
⎕IO←0 ⋄ ⎕ML←1

⍝ Build the db namespace by ⎕FIX-ing each file
'db'⎕NS ''
base←'d:/devel/duckdb-dyalog/db/'

⍝ Fix namespace files first
2 db.⎕FIX 'file://',base,'type.apln'
2 db.⎕FIX 'file://',base,'api.apln'
2 db.⎕FIX 'file://',base,'read.apln'
2 db.⎕FIX 'file://',base,'write.apln'

⍝ Fix ALL function files
files←⊃⎕NINFO⍠('Wildcard' 1)⊢base,'*.aplf'
{2 db.⎕FIX 'file://',⍵}¨files

⍝ Initialize with lib folder
db.init 'd:\devel\duckdb-dyalog\lib\'

